 "final_prompt": "Make a buy-list for a lemon garlic chicken dinner with potatoes. I've got salt, olive oil and oregano already. Only include what I still have to purchase, which should be chicken, lemons, garlic and potatoes. One per line, four lines, no cooking directions.\n\n<document>\nWeeknight lemon chicken (serves 4)\n\nIngredients\n4 chicken thighs\n2 lemons\n3 cloves garlic\n1 tbsp olive oil\n1 tsp dried oregano\n1 lb baby potatoes\nsalt\n\nSteps\n1. Preheat the oven to 425°F.\n2. Toss the potatoes with the olive oil and salt.\n3. Rub the chicken with garlic, oregano and lemon zest.\n4. Roast everything for 35 minutes, squeeze the lemons over the top, and serve.\n</document>",
